# Formspree form ID for the rental + consultation forms.
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io (sign in with, or set the notify
#    email to, claycreationshq@gmail.com).
# 2. Copy the ID from the endpoint it gives you — the part after "/f/"
#    (e.g. "xldergqw" from https://formspree.io/f/xldergqw).
# 3. Put it below in a local .env.local file (copy this file), and set the
#    same variable in your Vercel project settings for production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
